{'symbol': 'MRO', 'date': '2022-02-16 16:16:00', 'title': 'MARATHON OIL ANNOUNCES 2022 CAPITAL BUDGET AND REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021 RESULTS', 'text': "HOUSTON , FEB. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARATHON OIL CORPORATION (NYSE:MRO) REPORTED FOURTH QUARTER 2022 NET INCOME OF $649 MILLION, OR $0.84 PER DILUTED SHARE, WHICH INCLUDES THE IMPACT OF CERTAIN ITEMS NOT TYPICALLY REPRESENTED IN ANALYSTS' EARNINGS ESTIMATES AND THAT WOULD OTHERWISE AFFECT COMPARABILITY OF RESULTS. THE ADJUSTED NET INCOME WAS $592 MILLION, OR $0.77 PER DILUTED SHARE."}